#: src/renderer/src/components/VaultPortabilityDialog.tsx:93
msgid "KeePass 2 XML is unencrypted plaintext containing directly readable passwords. Only open it from a trusted encrypted drive, and securely delete it after importing. BearWarden imports personal entries only and flattens nested groups into folder paths. Attachment binaries, history revisions, and advanced metadata are not imported, and recycle-bin and template groups are skipped. Modern KeePass TimeOtp fields are converted into a code-generating format. If the secret, encoding, or parameters conflict or cannot be converted, the entire import stops instead of silently skipping the authenticator."
msgstr "KeePass 2 XML 是未加密的明文，其中包含可直接读取的密码。请仅从受信任的加密驱动器打开它，并在导入后安全删除。BearWarden 仅导入个人条目，并将嵌套组展平为文件夹路径。不会导入附件二进制文件、历史修订版本和高级元数据，并会跳过回收站和模板组。现代 KeePass TimeOtp 字段会转换为可生成代码的格式。如果密钥、编码或参数冲突，或无法转换，整个导入将停止，而不会静默跳过身份验证器。"

